noPhotos

# anti-B0 -> D_s+ anti-K0 e- nu (PHSP), isospin partner of Bplus/DsKenu (B+ -> D_s- K+ e+ nu):
# spectator d-bar -> anti-K0 instead of B+'s spectator u-bar -> K+ (see
# decfiles/gap_modes/B0/DsKenu/decay.dec for the referenced isospin derivation,
# arXiv:2605.03021 Eqs. 5-8). BR fixed to 0 in this cocktail component (see config.yaml) --
# included for categorization/gap-accounting completeness, not as an SM contribution.

Decay Upsilon(4S)
1.0  B0sig  anti-B0sig  VSS_BMIX dm;
Enddecay

Decay anti-B0sig
1.0  D_s+   anti-K0  e-  anti-nu_e   PHSP;
Enddecay
CDecay B0sig

End
